    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Unravel the Secrets of Shimagami</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a post-apocalyptic world where men have vanished, only demi-human women remain to save world from creatures. The land\u2019s inhabitants worship a mysterious deity known as Shimagami.But what secrets lie hidden beneath this divine figure?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shimagami is an open-world action RPG with fast-paced combat, vibrant anime-style visuals, and deep lore. Explore a vast and mysterious world, battle formidable creatures, solve intricate puzzles, and complete challenging trials to uncover the truth behind Shimagami\u2019s legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each warrior you meet is a unique demi-human heroine\u2014ranging from fierce dragon-girls to cunning cat-girls and powerful demon-girls. Every character wields a completely different weapon, with distinct combat styles, animations, and abilities. Master their skills, adapt to different battle scenarios, and forge your own path through the ruins of a forgotten civilization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With regular updates introducing new characters and story expansions, the journey never ends. Are you ready to uncover the truth behind Shimagami?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Unravel the Secrets of Shimagami</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a post-apocalyptic world where men have vanished, only demi-human women remain to save world from creatures. The land\u2019s inhabitants worship a mysterious deity known as Shimagami.But what secrets lie hidden beneath this divine figure?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shimagami is an open-world action RPG with fast-paced combat, vibrant anime-style visuals, and deep lore. Explore a vast and mysterious world, battle formidable creatures, solve intricate puzzles, and complete challenging trials to uncover the truth behind Shimagami\u2019s legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each warrior you meet is a unique demi-human heroine\u2014ranging from fierce dragon-girls to cunning cat-girls and powerful demon-girls. Every character wields a completely different weapon, with distinct combat styles, animations, and abilities. Master their skills, adapt to different battle scenarios, and forge your own path through the ruins of a forgotten civilization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With regular updates introducing new characters and story expansions, the journey never ends. Are you ready to uncover the truth behind Shimagami?</p>",
    "short_description": "Shimagami is an open-world RPG with anime-style visuals and deep lore. Battle fierce monsters in action combat, solve puzzles, and conquer challenges to uncover the mysteries of Shimagami. A diverse cast of demi-human heroines awaits\u2014find your perfect companion and shape your adventure!",
